---
// Benefits component for Pricing page
---

<section class="py-20">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-sm font-medium py-1 px-3 rounded-full text-primary bg-primary/10">
        Beneficios
      </span>
      <h2 class="md:text-3xl/tight text-3xl font-semibold my-4">
        Todos los planes incluyen estos beneficios
      </h2>
      <p class="md:text-lg text-slate-500 leading-7">
        Algunos beneficios de la suscripción mensual/anual
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 grid-cols-1 gap-6 gap-y-10 mt-16">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center lg:justify-center gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/20 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <g stroke="none" stroke-width="1" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
                  <rect id="bound" x="0" y="0" width="24" height="24"></rect>
                  <path d="M13.0799676,14.7839934 L15.2839934,12.5799676 C15.8927139,11.9712471 16.0436229,11.0413042 15.6586342,10.2713269 L15.5337539,10.0215663 C15.1487653,9.25158901 15.2996742,8.3216461 15.9083948,7.71292558 L18.6411989,4.98012149 C18.836461,4.78485934 19.1530435,4.78485934 19.3483056,4.98012149 C19.3863063,5.01812215 19.4179321,5.06200062 19.4419658,5.11006808 L20.5459415,7.31801948 C21.3904962,9.0071287 21.0594452,11.0471565 19.7240871,12.3825146 L13.7252616,18.3813401 C12.2717221,19.8348796 10.1217008,20.3424308 8.17157288,19.6923882 L5.75709327,18.8875616 C5.49512161,18.8002377 5.35354162,18.5170777 5.4408655,18.2551061 C5.46541191,18.1814669 5.50676633,18.114554 5.56165376,18.0596666 L8.21292558,15.4083948 C8.8216461,14.7996742 9.75158901,14.6487653 10.5215663,15.0337539 L10.7713269,15.1586342 C11.5413042,15.5436229 12.4712471,15.3927139 13.0799676,14.7839934 Z" fill="currentcolor"></path>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="text-base">Soporte Técnico</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Nuestro equipo de soporte técnico profesional te ayudará en cada paso</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center lg:justify-center gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/20 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <g stroke="none" stroke-width="1" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
                  <rect id="bound" x="0" y="0" width="24" height="24"></rect>
                  <path d="M12,21 C7.02943725,21 3,16.9705627 3,12 C3,7.02943725 7.02943725,3 12,3 C16.9705627,3 21,7.02943725 21,12 C21,16.9705627 16.9705627,21 12,21 Z M14.1654881,7.35483745 L9.61055177,10.3622525 C9.47921741,10.4489666 9.39637436,10.592455 9.38694497,10.7495509 L9.05991526,16.197949 C9.04337012,16.4735952 9.25341309,16.7104632 9.52905936,16.7270083 C9.63705011,16.7334903 9.74423017,16.7047714 9.83451193,16.6451626 L14.3894482,13.6377475 C14.5207826,13.5510334 14.6036256,13.407545 14.613055,13.2504491 L14.9400847,7.80205104 C14.9566299,7.52640477 14.7465869,7.28953682 14.4709406,7.27299168 C14.3629499,7.26650974 14.2557698,7.29522855 14.1654881,7.35483745 Z" fill="currentcolor"></path>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="text-base">Tecnología</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Una formación especial para empezar a usar la plataforma con profesionales</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center lg:justify-center gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/20 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <g stroke="none" stroke-width="1" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
                  <rect id="bound" x="0" y="0" width="24" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect fill="currentcolor" opacity="0.3" x="13" y="4" width="3" height="16" rx="1.5"></rect>
                  <rect fill="currentcolor" x="8" y="9" width="3" height="11" rx="1.5"></rect>
                  <rect fill="currentcolor" x="18" y="11" width="3" height="9" rx="1.5"></rect>
                  <rect fill="currentcolor" x="3" y="13" width="3" height="7" rx="1.5"></rect>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="text-base">Análisis de Crecimiento</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Un equipo dedicado a obtener información sobre tu crecimiento cada mes</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center lg:justify-center gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/20 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <g stroke="none" stroke-width="1" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
                  <rect id="bound" x="0" y="0" width="24" height="24"></rect>
                  <path d="M8,8 L8,8 C8.55228475,8 9,8.44771525 9,9 L9,18 C9,18.5522847 8.55228475,19 8,19 L8,19 C7.44771525,19 7,18.5522847 7,18 L7,9 C7,8.44771525 7.44771525,8 8,8 Z M13,8 L13,8 C13.5522847,8 14,8.44771525 14,9 L14,18 C14,18.5522847 13.5522847,19 13,19 L13,19 C12.4477153,19 12,18.5522847 12,18 L12,9 C12,8.44771525 12.4477153,8 13,8 Z M4.06055214,5 L16.9394479,5 C17.4917326,5 17.9394479,5.44771525 17.9394479,6 C17.9394479,6.01958668 17.9388724,6.03916914 17.9377222,6.05872202 L17.1107386,20.117444 C17.0485547,21.1745693 16.1731425,22 15.1141898,22 L5.88581016,22 C4.82685754,22 3.95144525,21.1745693 3.88926141,20.117444 L3.06227777,6.05872202 C3.02984649,5.50739031 3.4504984,5.0341569 4.00183012,5.00172563 C4.021383,5.00057546 4.04096546,5 4.06055214,5 Z" fill="currentcolor"></path>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="text-base">Recompensas</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Una recompensa especial para la cuenta con mejor rendimiento cada mes que sea relacionado al sistema de Agoramy POS</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
